        "speaker": "S1",
        "text": "Welcome to the Tuesday evening cooking class. My name is Chef Rosa, and I will be your teacher for the next six weeks. Each class starts at six thirty and finishes at eight thirty. Please arrive ten minutes early, because we begin on time. Tonight we are making a vegetable soup and homemade bread. Everything is on the tables: onions, carrots, potatoes and flour. First, please wash your hands and put on an apron. The aprons are in the blue box by the door. Next week we will cook pasta with a tomato sauce, and the week after that we will make a chicken curry. If you are allergic to any food, please tell me now. For example, Mr Lee told me last week that he cannot eat nuts, so there are none in tonight's bread. At the end of each class, you can eat what you cook, or you can take it home in a box. The class costs one hundred and twenty pounds for six weeks. Does anyone have any questions before we start?"
      }
    ]
